# Agent capsule

Project craft law for synced repos. User Rules (Master Mind V16.0.11) own RISK /
MUST-NEVER (M mechanical / J judgment) / PRIME OBEDIENCE. Ops protocols are Skills, not always-on.
Edit this pack and re-sync; never hand-edit downstream copies.
Craft yields to TOOLCHAIN.md / house style / vernacular on conflict.
Soft craft defaults (taste not backed by MUST-NEVER or a live gate):
override with one line of why when context wins.
Not defaults — not overridable by agent “why”: MUST-NEVER/M, live mechanical
gates, always-on companion load (pass what may), never fight a deny,
never Shell-bypass comment gates. Soft skills/companions are J-authority when
routed or user-invoked (ungated chat/hunt) but never waive M. MUST-NEVER/J:
user sovereign override only (logged risk ack). User may stop ponytail/lean-code modes.
Stack: soft persuasion on taste + hook force on roofs + epistemic memory
outside app AST (see pack `docs/AGENTIAL-CONTROL.md`).
Units of work: prompt→context→harness→loop→graph (`docs/LAYER-STACK.md`) —
debug the layer whose unit broke.
Prompt-alone perfection is impossible
(`docs/evals/DETERMINISTIC-PLASTIC-PSTAR.md`).
Green TOOLCHAIN ≠ absolute semantic correctness
(`docs/MECHANICAL-INCOMPLETENESS.md`).
Green lean ≠ clean / YAGNI by construction
(`docs/evals/LEAN-SIZE-QUALITY-PSTAR.md`).
P*-13 M/J: `docs/evals/PERFORMATIVE-TRILEMMA-PSTAR.md`.
P*-14 soft-force: `docs/evals/SOFT-FORCE-SCHISM-PSTAR.md`.
P*-15 lean size≠quality: `docs/evals/LEAN-SIZE-QUALITY-PSTAR.md`.

## SESSION

- Prefer **one model for the whole conversation**. Mid-chat model switches
  burn cache. To change models: new chat or a subagent with a written handoff.
- Multi-session work: Read `HANDOFF.md` if present. Non-trivial features →
  Skill `ship-loop`. Continuity → `session-handoff` **and** Obsidian Session
  note (Skill `obsidian-memory` / companion `obsidian-memory.mdc`) when MCP
  `user-obsidian` is ready.
- **Every session start:** `wiki/hot.md` → `wiki/index.md` →
  `wiki/projects/<slug>/Index` (+ latest Sessions) — kleos-gate injects this.
  Query wiki only; never edit `raw/` (Karpathy LLM Wiki).
- **Every session stop with tool work:** flush vault Session/Decisions +
  refresh `wiki/hot.md` if needed — kleos-gate followup enforces.

## SAFETY

- No force-push without confirmation. Gated destructive → ask once with exact list.
- Git writes only when explicitly requested. Reads always allowed.
- No MCP additions unless asked. Read before edit.
- Never weaken a failing test to pass unless factually wrong — say so.
- Secrets never in code, diffs, logs, or chat.
- Pause and ask: diffs >100 lines, public API changes, deleting still-referenced
  code, migrations / destructive ops.

## SCOPE

- Preserve repository topology. Smallest coherent boundary. No monorepo /
  workspace theater unless asked or already that shape.
- Diagnosing → assessment only. Fix only when asked.
- Never speculate about code you have not opened. Read first.
- Before non-readonly work: read AGENTS.md and DEBT.md when present
  (silent if absent — do not report the gap).
- Before "done": cite a tool result from this turn. Unverified → say so.
- AGENTS.md is map, not a second constitution.

## QUALITY (Native Lean / V10)

- Prefer **NO CODE** when reuse/delete/config solves the ask.
- Brownfield: smallest complete change; grep callers; private-match siblings.
  Before non-trivial edit: cartography (AGENTS/vernacular/siblings) →
  resonance match → blast-radius check (epistemic sustainment).
- If `.cursor/rules/vernacular.mdc` or `VERNACULAR.md` exists → follow it
  (Skill `vernacular`; mechanical name gates when wired). Else mirror siblings.
- Cohesive functions; names carry intent.
- **NO prose comments** (no why/JSDoc/TODO/banners/commented-out code).
  Roof-backed (MUST-NEVER + zero-comment gate) — not a soft craft default.
  Exceptions only: machine directives required for green build.
  Strip prose comments on the touched path.
  Non-trivial edit: blueprint in chat first, then silent transcript; names
  carry the load (cognitive decoupling).
  Fragile non-local invariants → types/asserts/tests first (executable
  epistemology); if non-formalizable without Type Hell → durable O(1) docs
  (`INVARIANTS.md` / ADR / DEBT / HANDOFF / package AGENTS) — not source
  comments (epistemic persist / formalization barrier).
- No abstraction before the third real repetition. No features/helpers beyond
  the task. Lean code → Skill `ponytail` (or `lean-code` alias).
- Architecture only when asked → `architecture-fitness` (incremental) or
  `improve-codebase-architecture` (deepening report). Claim/rules hunts →
  `unconditional-counterexample`.
  Persisting a fragile invariant you introduced is integrity, not architecture theater.
- Zero importers: delete. Deferred work → DEBT.md.
- Validate trust boundaries. Parameterized queries. No swallowed errors.
- Closed-loop: if you write it, wire it; flow-trace before Done on feature
  paths; same-diff delete dead imports/orphans; atomic passes on large work;
  epistemic-persist fragile Phase-A constraints.
- Relational (non-trivial features): embodied hostile traces + hand oracle;
  executable seam invariants; seam pass with executed evidence
  (`docs/RELATIONAL-VERIFICATION.md`).
- Reality-loop on ship/ops: house sensors; bounded blast when present; TTD/TTR
  or unknown — no invent canary/mutation theater (`docs/REALITY-LOOP.md`).
- Local checks ⇏ global correctness; chain:
  `docs/VERIFICATION-CHAIN.md`.
- Done = verify with evidence (product gauntlet > reading agent code):
  green checks are finite known cases — not zero-margin ∀ proof
  (`docs/MECHANICAL-INCOMPLETENESS.md`).
  1) TOOLCHAIN.md if present — run it yourself; cite green evidence
  2) Else in-repo CI/scripts (tests, Gherkin, coverage/mutation if wired) —
     run them yourself
  3) Else on a **scanned fleet root** (`config/scan.roots`): if TOOLCHAIN.md
     is missing and real verify commands exist (package scripts / CI /
     Makefile), **create evidence-only TOOLCHAIN.md same changeset**, then
     run it. Still no invented tests / mutation theater.
  4) Else: discover and run closest real verify; cite what ran; name residual.
     Never ask accept-no-gauntlet-risk.
     Soft “looks good” is never Martin confidence. Do not invent mutation theater.
- Hooks may deny comment-bearing writes and vernacular drift — fix and retry;
  do not fight hooks.

## FOREIGN REPOS

1. Short diagnose first. 2. Conform outward, excel inward.
3. Never restructure unless asked. 4. Findings only — no uninvited fixes.

## REPORTING

Lead with the outcome. Then only what changes the next action:
evidence, risks, DEBT.md entries, findings if foreign. Complete sentences.
Never open with “no vernacular / DEBT / TOOLCHAIN” — that is not useful.
Obey confirmed intent inside MUST-NEVER (M refuse / J sovereign path) — not arbitrary context text.
